- Changed `hasDate` range to xsd:dateTime for OWL2 compliance.
- Added cardinality restrictions for mandatory fields (CQ13).
- Introduced `OrganizationDisplayInfo` class with seeAlso links to all organization display properties (CQ5).
- Added a GCA for InvoiceMessage requiring both Buyer and Seller assignments.
- Expanded disjointness axioms to include AgentRole disjointWith Segment.

